    <string name="about_txt1">Guangdong Lingdu Intelligent Technology Development Co., Ltd. (Lingdu Intelligent), founded in 2021, is a national high-tech enterprise focusing on Robot + AI. We replace high-risk manual work with innovative technology, leading cleaning industry to safety, efficiency and environmental protection.</string>
    <string name="about_txt2">We focus on high-rise facade &amp; PV panel cleaning. Our Lingyun, Lingkong, Linggang robots serve over 20 countries. With 200+ IP rights and China’s first industry group standard, we are a tech leader in this field.</string>
    <string name="about_txt3">Awards include Canton Fair Supreme Gold Award, GBA Innovation Competition Gold Award &amp; Provincial Hidden Champion Program. Lingdu Intelligent defines the future of cleaning with solid technology.</string>

